          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Tláw dír doó waawutmoó Yuda ku beer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‹Kuúng waawutmoó Yuda kuúngudá' aga iwit gawaá kitángw waawuti'iimaár Daudi, dinkwa nee sagadiyuuserók nee mukók kwí daraahá' ar afeerí, axweesante'eé' iiárií qaasaak anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Muruú ganaá' nee oo qoóm tlehhiitaak. Heé taa daqaari'iima hayóh /iisaak dabaá múk /aytuuseero. Muu mu slahh'eemisaara' nee dahaayeero, tam na/aá panaay nee kwaeeliwo. Tam tseerdaá múk dakuús wásl mi diirí ku'umiisara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesante'eé' tí bar aga iialooesé' naagáy daqaní waawitaádá' waawuti'i'iím gawaá kitángw Daudi wa alé, i kumiit darhuú afkú doó waawutmoowo. Inooín dinkwa nee sagadiyuuser'ín nee muk'ine, tari tsa/aa/án gawaá daandemaá faras, nee gawaá gaardaá faras i uuruxun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes aga iialooeesi'iiká baraá axweesante'eé' tihe, anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ lo'o aga /aáy adór yaamuuká' ngir taangu tleéhh. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy múk yaariír oo xoordaá hatlá' barta waaraahh bihhaá gixsadae umuú heewo heé hatlá' gun yaahaas, in ooi, ‹Ahaá waáy, gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ adoorí ngisa tleéhh dír gixsarí ur?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiri mu/aywaats nee múk hatlá', ‹Asma inooín alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nga oohi'iiká, nee munguaá hatlá' ngiri haratlintaati'iyé', nee ngay sluufmiisiyé'.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
