          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma daanduú Shalumu garmoó Yosiawo, waawutmoó Yuda, kudá' aa waawuti'in alaá baabuúwós Yosiawo, Shalumudá' aa diirí wa tlay, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Inós baloó diirí ki/iiká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala in gwaa' amoodár kilá' kway huúw baraá lawaali'iima. Tam ado gaalá yaamuuká' gi baloó ariiká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
